# A new game, the inventory, the behaviour menu, quitting (which saves) and
# the save loaded back. Areas are of the 1280x960 screen dosrun's DOSBox
# draws in.

wait menu 814x76+234+470 150
key Return
wait name 400x56+440+152 60
key a b c Return
# the introduction's text: the corner it leaves to the planet
wait text 400x200+700+620 60
key Escape
sleep 8
key Escape
wait scene 280x200+300+124 240

# the inventory opens on Shift, closes on Escape: its grid
down Shift_L
sleep 0.3
up Shift_L
wait inventory 400x150+190+140 30
key Escape
sleep 2

# the behaviour menu stays while Ctrl is held: its label
down Control_L
wait behaviour 380x60+620+500 30
up Control_L
sleep 2

# Escape asks to continue or give up, which saves: the left of Quit game
key Escape
wait quit 300x60+240+452 30
key Down Return
# the main menu again, drawn over the scene: the left of its lower
# buttons, clear of Twinsen behind them
wait menu2 300x150+240+390 90

# Continue saved game, the only save: the list's title
key Down Return
wait choose 520x50+380+160 30
key Return
# a save of the first chapter replays the introduction
wait text 400x200+700+620 60
sleep 1
shot intro
key Escape
sleep 8
shot movie
key Escape
wait loaded 280x200+300+124 240
